  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="headerCard">
      <div>
        <h1 style="margin:0">Upcoming cohorts & workshops</h1>
        <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">Cohorts are small, timed, and designed for steady progress — limited seats.</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" style="padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#7ef0b8);text-decoration:none;color:#05311a;font-weight:900">Reserve a seat</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="programs">
      <div class="prog">
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:800">Rhythm Lab — 8-Week Cohort</div>
          <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:6px">Weekly small-group sessions + accountability pods.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:right">
          <div style="font-weight:900">Starts May 3</div>
          <div class="tags"><span class="tag">Cohort</span><span class="tag">8 weeks</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prog">
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:800">Weekend Clinic: Travel Routines</div>
          <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:6px">One focused session to adapt routines for travel and transitions.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:right">
          <div style="font-weight:900">Next: Apr 12</div>
          <div class="tags"><span class="tag">90 min</span><span class="tag">Interactive</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prog">
